Lets a custom geometry source fail a tile, as a custom vector source can. The
failed tile stays subscribed, so invalidating it or needing it again fetches
it again (https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/778). Needs
0069.
Upstream: not proposed

